binutils-2.41-compat (2.41-6deepin18+compat1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Compatibility-only repackaging of GNU binutils 2.41.
  * Build and install only the versioned private runtime libraries:
    - libopcodes-2.41-system.so
    - libbfd-2.41-system.so
    - libsframe.so.1
  * These libraries are required by prebuilt binaries linked against
    binutils 2.41, such as the objtool shipped in
    linux-headers-7.3.0-amd64-desktop-rolling.
  * The "-system" SONAME suffix keeps this package co-installable with
    binutils 2.47 (libopcodes-2.47-system.so, libbfd-2.47-system.so and
    libsframe.so.3).
  * Do not build or install the binutils programs or development files.

 -- lichenggang <lichenggang@uniontech.com>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 16:00:00 +0800
